  "translate_en|mods/FruityFarmer/42/media/lua/shared/Translate/EN/Sandbox.json|Sandbox_FruityFarmer_FruitTreeGrowingSeasons_tooltip": "Controls winter dormancy for Fruity Farmer trees. Follow Vanilla uses the global Growing Seasons setting. Always Seasonal enforces November-through-February dormancy. Always Year-Round disables fruit-tree dormancy.",
